<name>Audio System</name>
<para id="RM0000008JL017X" category="J" type-id="801HT" name-id="641GV-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Noise in radio sound only</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000008JL017X_04" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000008JL017X_05" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM0000008JL017X_05_0024" proc-id="RM0550J___00005FB00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Malfunction Occurrence Conditions</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect Malfunction Occurrence Conditions</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check under what conditions (locations) noise occurs.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Occurs regardless of location</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Occurs in specific locations</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0025" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0031" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000008JL017X_05_0025" proc-id="RM0550J___00005FC00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Aftermarket Parts (Sunshade Film, Telephone Antenna, etc.)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect aftermarket parts</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check whether aftermarket parts such as sunshade film or a telephone antenna are installed.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No aftermarket parts (including non-genuine wiring)</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Noise entering the radio is suppressed to a level that causes no practical problems, so extremely loud noise is not expected. If loud noise occurs, check that the ground at the antenna installation area is normal, that all genuine noise suppression parts are installed, and that there is no non-genuine wiring.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0026" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0032" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000008JL017X_05_0026" proc-id="RM0550J___00005FD00000">
<testtitle>Inspect with Antenna Plug Removed (Radio Receiver Assembly Side)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect Antenna Plug and Inspect</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>With the antenna plug disconnected from the radio receiver assembly, operate the radio receiver assembly again and check whether noise occurs.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No noise</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Noise occurs</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0027" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0033" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000008JL017X_05_0027" proc-id="RM0550J___00005FE00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Antenna Ground Installation Condition</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect ground installation condition</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check that the ground section of the amplifier antenna assembly is securely attached to the body.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installation normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check that the ground section of antenna cord No.2 is securely attached to the body.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installation normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0028" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0034" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000008JL017X_05_0028" proc-id="RM0550J___00005FF00000">
<testtitle>Inspect with Connector Disconnected (Amplifier Antenna Assembly Side)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect Antenna Connector and Inspect</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>With the connector at the connection between the amplifier antenna assembly and antenna cord No.2 disconnected, operate the radio receiver assembly again and check whether noise occurs.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Noise occurs</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No noise</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0029" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000008JL017X_05_0035" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000008JL017X_05_0029" proc-id="RM0550J___00005FG00000">
<testtitle>Inspect with Connector Disconnected (Antenna Cord NO.2)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect Antenna Connector and Inspect</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>With the connector at the connection between antenna cord No.2 and the antenna cord disconnected, operate the radio receiver assembly again and check whether noise occurs.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.99in"/>
